prompts.prompt:
Generate 4 product features for "{title}"{category_clause}.
{description_clause}
Each feature should have:
- A title (2-5 words, descriptive and slightly humorous)
- A description (10-15 words, technical yet poetic)
- Suggested icon from this list: {icon_list}

Format as JSON array:
[
  {
    "icon": "telescope",
    "title": "Feature Title",
    "description": "Brief description with dry humor and technical detail"
  }
]

Return ONLY the JSON array, no other text.

Generate {max_tags} relevant tags for this product:

Title: {title}
Category: {category}
{description_clause}
Tags should be:
- Relevant to the product's function and features
- Include both technical and descriptive terms
- Mix of specific and general terms
- Suitable for search and categorization

Return ONLY a comma-separated list of tags, nothing else.

Generate 6-8 technical specifications for "{title}", a {category}.
{description_clause}
Each specification should include realistic, appropriate technical details for this type of product.

Format as JSON array of label-value pairs:
[
  { "label": "Dimensions", "value": "100 × 50 × 25 mm" },
  { "label": "Weight", "value": "250g" }
]

Include specifications like dimensions, weight, materials, power requirements, operating conditions, etc.
Return ONLY the JSON array, no markdown formatting, no other text.
